    "review_summary": "All 95 fixed-scope hashes match. Reviewed the nine formal pages, three variants, three bindings and reverse associations. P1/P3 I–IV subtract 7/8/9/10 percentage points; P4 subtracts 6.5/7/7.5/8 points, with normalized peril clamped to [0,1]. The held plus same-item weakspot on-hit gate, lack of an extra ranged/kill gate, shared boolean coalescing and next-Buff-update processing are accurately stated. Holster preserves an accepted flag while installed; true unequip removes the on-equip Buff. The exploding-state interrupt is correctly limited to peril still exploding at drain time. Direct projectiles preserve the original item and target hit-zone; P4 direct-hit versus stopped/non-damageable collision explosion branches are distinguished; P1/P4 center_mass selection and P3 center_mass lightning remain subject to breed weakspot mapping/guaranteed-weakspot rules. Actual staff special melee sweeps can qualify on their own weakspot flag, while pure push and manual vent do not. RAW/four-tier formatting, five-column rule comparisons, percentage-point examples, actual UI bindings and icon 002 receipt are consistent. No issue found."
  },
